cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this implementation or its evaluation record, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Nyqo n1"
authors:
  - family-names: "Markov-Tsoy"
    given-names: "Artur"
  - family-names: "Ayupov"
    given-names: "Daniel"
version: "n1"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
url: "https://github.com/Hxtomi/nyqo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hxtomi/nyqo"
abstract: >-
  Nyqo n1 is a compact, general-purpose language model with 497M parameters.
  It builds on LiquidAI LFM2.5-350M through block expansion, supervised
  post-training, and distillation from the base model and an earlier Nyqo
  checkpoint. This repository provides the
  model implementation, inference tools, and evaluation results.
keywords:
  - compact language models
  - model adaptation
  - knowledge distillation
  - block expansion
